* **[NEW] [backend-cd.yml](file:///c:/Users/vishnu%20vardhan%20reddy/Downloads/OmniCharge/.github/workflows/backend-cd.yml):** Automates building Docker images and pushing them to Docker Hub on new version tags (`v*`).
